## 🇮🇳 Final Message

An SSB Board does **not** select the person who gives the most perfect answers.

It selects the person who consistently demonstrates:

* Integrity
* Responsibility
* Leadership
* Team spirit
* Learning attitude
* Emotional stability
* Love for the nation

If you carry these qualities into your preparation and real life, you will give yourself the best chance of success.

